#!/usr/bin/env python3
r"""ascii-viewer FILE: a video, an audio file or a still image, as text.

A video plays as ASCII art, decoded in this process (Decoder, PyAV) and drawn by libchafa in
the terminal's 16 ANSI colours, so the theme sets the hues, in time with its sound from a
headless mpv; a status line goes over the bottom row. Audio alone shows an
oscilloscope (scope); playerctl drives either over MPRIS. A still image (an SVG through resvg)
shows as itself in kitty, over its graphics protocol, else as ASCII. r opens the render page
(RenderPage): the picture as ascii-convert would save it.

Keys, mpv's where it has them and qView's for still images (a: with audio alone too):
key                     a  video                              still image
q Q                     a  quit                               same
F1                      a  these keys (video pauses)          same
space p                 a  pause, play; stopped: from 0 s     -
h l Left Right          a  seek -5 s, +5 s                    previous, next image; zoomed: pan
j k Down Up             a  seek -60 s, +60 s                  turn left, right; zoomed: pan
Shift+Left Shift+Right  a  seek -1 s, +1 s                    zoomed: pan, a sixteenth
Shift+Down Shift+Up     a  seek -5 s, +5 s                    zoomed: pan, a sixteenth
[ ] { }                 a  speed /1.1, x1.1; /2, x2           -
Backspace \             a  speed 100 %                        Backspace: zoom to the fit
9 0 / *                 a  volume -2, +2                      -
m                       a  mute                               -
L                       a  loop (else the end quits)          zoomed: pan, a sixteenth
H J K                      -                                  zoomed: pan, a sixteenth
f                       a  fullscreen (Hyprland)              same
. ,                        a frame forward, back, paused      -
3 4                        level 5 % darker, brighter         same
1 2                        contrast -5 %, +5 %                same
`                          level and contrast back to 0       same
7 8                        saturation -10 %, +10 %            same
c                          mono: the theme's brightest only   same
b                          bold glyphs                        same
g                          glyphs: mixed, density, shape      same
s                          screenshot (ascii-convert --at)    screenshot: all of it, as turned
r                          render page; F1 there: its keys    same
+ = -                      -                                  zoom in (+ =), out
v                          -                                  image (kitty) or ASCII
y                          -                                  copy it (PNG); after D: delete
d                          -                                  trash it, show the next
u                          -                                  undo the last trash
D                          -                                  delete for good, after y

With the folder's last image gone only u, q, f and F1 act; after D, any key but y keeps the
image.

Render page (r): a value typed or a theme search (/) takes the printable keys; Enter keeps a
value, Esc drops it, and Enter, Esc, Tab, Up or Down end a search (the last three move on):
key               menu                    list (size, theme)      crop editor
F1                these keys              these keys              these keys
j k Down Up       move down, up           move down, up           window down, up 5 %
h l Left Right    value down, up          back, pick              window left, right 5 %
J K H L           -                       -                       the same by 1 %
Tab               -                       move down               -
Enter             open or set it          pick                    back to the menu
q Esc             back to the player      back to the menu        back to the menu
Q r               back to the player      -                       -
`                 back to the default     -                       -
s                 export the PNG          -                       -
/                 search the themes       search (themes)         -
- + =             -                       -                       window smaller, larger
[ ]               -                       -                       ratio: previous, next
< > { }           -                       -                       width, height (free ratio)
c 0               -                       -                       centre it; the whole picture
Backspace         typing: delete          search: delete          -
"""

